{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110717","id":2845836637,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6poAVd","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110717","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110717.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110717.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110717","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110717/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110717/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110717/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b18beb2cc21259bf7a4a9780a44b160dedf22802","number":110717,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Elide unnecessary copies in `CONSTRUCT_TYPED_*` opcodes","user":{"login":"Shadows-of-Fire","id":3682588,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODI1ODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3682588?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire","html_url":"https://github.com/Shadows-of-Fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR fixes an issue that was noticed by @AdriaandeJongh while looking at the benchmark results used in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110709\r\n\r\nIn those benchmark results, the time it took to use initializer-list syntax to create a typed dictionary with 64 entries was 3x as long as the time it took to create an untyped dictionary.\r\n\r\nThis is because instead of using `set_typed`, both `OPCODE_CONSTRUCT_TYPED_ARRAY` and `OPCODE_CONSTRUCT_TYPED_DICTIONARY` first construct an untyped dictionary, fill it, and use the copy constructor that accepts type parameters to create a typed copy of the dictionary.\r\n\r\nBy migrating these to use `set_typed` instead, and re-running the benchmark from #110709, the time for typed and untyped dictionaries is effectively identical.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4